WARNING:SPLIT_STRING: quoted string split across lines
#274: FILE: arch/powerpc/platforms/pseries/iommu.c:1235:
 		dev_dbg(&dev->dev, "can't map partition max 0x%llx with %llu "
+			  "%llu-sized pages\n", 1ULL << len, query.largest_available_block,

Quoted strings that appear as messages in userspace and can be
grepped, should not be split across multiple lines.

See: https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20120203052727.GA15035@leaf/

CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'len == max_ram_len'
#292: FILE: arch/powerpc/platforms/pseries/iommu.c:1324:
+	if (pmem_present && dma_addr && (len == max_ram_len))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

